      textbook: "Check the textbook for how the court resolved the Starbucks pin case. The slide leaves it as a question. Also note: in the statute, union ULPs are Section 8(b) of the NLRA. Slide 34 repeats \"Section 8(a)\" for union ULPs, which is a typo; employer ULPs are 8(a).",
